<title>AUSTRALIA: SPORT-TENNIS HOPMAN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SPORT-TENNIS HOPMAN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the second day of the Hopman Cup mixed teams tennis tournament on Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>2-Switzerland beat Romania 2-1</p>
<p>Singles (Swiss names first)</p>
<p>Marc Rosset lost to Adrian Voinea (forfeit)</p>
<p>Martina Hingis beat Irina Spirlea 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>Doubles</p>
<p>Rosset/Hingis beat Voinea/Spirlea 3-6 7-5 6-3</p>
</text>
